WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.393
Watch and read: Ama asks: Copy this sentence neatly: “Ama reads at school.” Which

00:00:05.393 --> 00:00:06.877
copy keeps every word?

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:13.073
The answer is: Ama reads at school.. Copy complete sentences legibly with correct

00:00:13.073 --> 00:00:14.313
spelling and punctuation.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:20.143
Watch and read: For your case practice, which spelling correctly writes the name of a

00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:20.813
person: ama?

00:00:21.617 --> 00:00:25.755
The answer is: Ama. Names of people begin with capital letters.
